==Trivia==
*Attack of the Omens is the only non-collab Gauntlet to introduce multiple new enemies.
*Attack of the Omens is the only Enigma Orb Gauntlet that features the main boss's [[Cerberus Kids|non-Colossus variant]] in it.
*Attack of the Omens is the only Colossal Gauntlet to feature an enemy that isn't incrementally buffed: [[Great Angel Chibinel]] appears at a constant 100% strength magnification for levels 1~10.

